      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "q62xfqo",
      "content": "<img></img>India's freedom struggle involved many great leaders who sacrificed their lives for independence. These freedom fighters used different methods such as political movements, social reforms, revolutionary activities, and mass protests to fight against British rule."
    },
